sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as PerfMonitor
    participant Pipe as Analytics pipeline (Ch 82)
    participant Vitals as Android vitals + dashboards

    User->>App: cold start / scroll / checkout
    App->>App: capture startup / frame metrics / custom trace (Ch 45/84) - low overhead
    App->>Pipe: report metric + context (device/OS/release/correlation) - PII-safe (Ch 28)
    Pipe->>Vitals: batched upload (Ch 82)
    Vitals->>Vitals: aggregate as p50/p90/p95/p99 by device/OS/release
    Vitals-->>App: regression on new release -> alert + gate/rollback (Ch 83/41)
